<view class="page redemption-page">
  <view class="redemption-heading"><view><view class="eyebrow">CLUB REWARDS</view><view class="title">俱乐部兑换</view></view><button class="text-button" bindtap="points">积分明细 ›</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在整理兑换记录…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}<button class="text-button" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新</button></view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice">{{notice}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loading && !member}}" class="empty">登录后查看可用积分和本人申请。<button class="primary full mt" bindtap="profile">前往登录</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{member && identityReady}}">
    <view class="redemption-wallet"><view><text class="redemption-balance">{{wallet.available}}</text><text class="redemption-unit">可用积分</text></view><view class="redemption-wallet-right"><text>余额 {{wallet.balance}} 分</text><text>已预留 {{wallet.held}} 分</text></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{wallet.restricted}}" class="notice error">账户积分有待核对事项，暂不能新增兑换。已有申请可联系主理人处理，交付前仍可取消。</view>
    <view class="redemption-tabs"><button class="redemption-tab {{mode === 'catalog' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="catalog" bindtap="switchView" disabled="{{loading || busy}}">物品与服务</button><button class="redemption-tab {{mode === 'mine' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="mine" bindtap="switchView" disabled="{{loading || busy}}">我的申请</button><button wx:if="{{isOwner}}" class="redemption-tab {{mode === 'manage' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="manage" bindtap="switchView" disabled="{{loading || busy}}">兑换管理</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{orderIntent}}" class="notice">{{orderIntent.itemName}} · {{orderIntent.cost}} 分的提交结果尚待核对。请先确认这次申请，避免重复提交。<button class="secondary full mt" bindtap="recoverOrder" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">核对原申请结果</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{itemIntent && mode !== 'manage'}}" class="notice">有一个项目的保存结果尚待核对。<button class="text-button" data-mode="manage" bindtap="switchView" disabled="{{busy}}">前往管理</button></view>

    <block wx:if="{{mode === 'catalog'}}">
      <view wx:if="{{!policy.enabled}}" class="redemption-note">俱乐部暂未开放新的兑换申请，已有申请仍可查看和处理。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{policy.ruleText}}" class="redemption-policy">{{policy.ruleText}}</view>
      <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="redemption-item"><view class="redemption-item-top"><text class="redemption-kind">{{item.kind === 'goods' ? '俱乐部物品' : '俱乐部服务'}}</text><text class="redemption-stock">可用 {{item.stockAvailable}} {{item.kind === 'goods' ? '件' : '位'}}</text></view><view class="redemption-item-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="redemption-item-description">{{item.description}}</view><view class="redemption-item-bottom"><view class="redemption-cost">{{item.pointsCost}}<text>分</text></view><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectItem" disabled="{{busy || orderIntent}}">查看并申请</button></view></view>
      <view wx:if="{{!loading && !items.length}}" class="empty">暂时没有开放的物品或服务。<text>{{'\n'}}</text>核定项目和名额后会在这里公布。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{selected}}" class="card redemption-confirm"><view class="row"><text class="card-title">{{selected.name}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="closeItem" disabled="{{busy || orderIntent}}">收起</button></view><view class="paragraph small muted mt">{{selected.description}}</view><view class="redemption-delivery"><text class="field-label">领取／服务安排</text><view class="paragraph small">{{selected.fulfillmentInstructions}}</view></view><view class="redemption-confirm-facts"><view><text>所需积分</text><text>{{selected.pointsCost}} 分</text></view><view><text>当前可用</text><text>{{wallet.available}} 分</text></view><view><text>可用名额</text><text>{{selected.stockAvailable}}</text></view></view><view class="redemption-note">每次申请一件物品或一次服务。提交后先预留积分和名额，实际交付后扣除；审核前后均可在交付前取消。</view><button class="primary full mt" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{busy || orderIntent || !policy.enabled || wallet.restricted || selected.stockAvailable < 1 || wallet.available < selected.pointsCost}}" loading="{{busy}}">{{!policy.enabled ? '暂未开放申请' : wallet.restricted ? '积分待核对' : selected.stockAvailable < 1 ? '暂无可用名额' : wallet.available < selected.pointsCost ? '可用积分不足' : '确认并提交申请'}}</button></view>
      <button class="text-button full mt" bindtap="consultation">兑换有疑问？向组织方咨询 ›</button>
    </block>

    <block wx:if="{{mode === 'mine'}}">
      <view wx:if="{{!loading && !mine.length}}" class="empty">还没有兑换申请。<button class="secondary full mt" data-mode="catalog" bindtap="switchView">看看可以兑换什么</button></view>
      <view wx:for="{{mine}}" wx:key="id" class="card redemption-request"><view class="row"><text class="tag">{{item.stateText}}</text><text class="redemption-request-cost">{{item.totalCost}} 分</text></view><view class="card-title mt">{{item.itemName}}</view><view class="small muted mt">{{item.itemDescription}}</view><view class="small mt">{{item.fulfillmentInstructions}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.reason}}" class="redemption-request-reason">处理说明：{{item.reason}}</view><view class="tiny muted mt">{{item.dateText}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.state === 'pending' || item.state === 'approved'}}" class="small muted mt">本次积分和名额已预留，尚未扣除。</view><view wx:if="{{item.state === 'refunded'}}" class="small muted mt">本笔兑换积分已退回，{{item.refundRestocked ? '库存／名额已恢复' : '库存／名额未恢复'}}。</view><button wx:if="{{item.canCancel}}" class="secondary full mt" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="cancel" disabled="{{busy}}">取消未交付申请</button></view>
      <view wx:if="{{mine.length}}" class="field"><text class="field-label">取消说明（选填）</text><input value="{{cancelReason}}" maxlength="500" bindinput="reason" placeholder="如需取消，可先补充说明" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view>
    </block>

    <block wx:if="{{mode === 'manage' && isOwner}}">
      <view class="redemption-management-tabs"><button class="pill {{managePane === 'items' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-pane="items" bindtap="managePane" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">项目与库存</button><button class="pill {{managePane === 'requests' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-pane="requests" bindtap="managePane" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">兑换处理</button><button class="pill {{managePane === 'policy' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-pane="policy" bindtap="managePane" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">积分规则</button></view>
      <block wx:if="{{managePane === 'items'}}">
        <button class="primary full" bindtap="newItem" disabled="{{busy || itemIntent}}">新增物品或服务</button>
        <view wx:for="{{adminItems}}" wx:key="id" class="card redemption-admin-item" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openItem"><view class="row"><text class="card-title">{{item.name}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.status === 'published' ? '已发布' : item.status === 'archived' ? '已归档' : '草稿'}}</text></view><view class="small muted mt">{{item.kind === 'goods' ? '物品' : '服务'}} · {{item.pointsCost}} 分</view><view class="redemption-inventory"><text>总量 {{item.totalStock}}</text><text>预留 {{item.heldStock}}</text><text>已交付 {{item.fulfilledStock}}</text></view><view class="redemption-item-open">编辑项目 ›</view></view>
        <view wx:if="{{!adminItems.length && !loading}}" class="empty">先添加经核定的物品或服务，再填写实际库存和交付安排。</view>
        <view wx:if="{{editor}}" class="card redemption-editor"><view class="card-title">{{itemForm.id ? '编辑兑换项目' : '新增兑换项目'}}</view><view wx:if="{{itemIntent}}" class="notice">这次保存结果尚待核对。内容已保留，重试会沿用原项目。</view><picker range="{{kindLabels}}" value="{{itemForm.kindIndex}}" bindchange="itemKind" disabled="{{busy || itemIntent || itemForm.id}}"><view class="picker mt">{{kindLabels[itemForm.kindIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><view class="field"><text class="field-label">项目名称</text><input value="{{itemForm.name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="itemField" maxlength="60" disabled="{{busy || itemIntent}}" placeholder="经核定的物品或服务名称"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">项目说明</text><textarea value="{{itemForm.description}}" data-field="description" bindinput="itemField" maxlength="1000" disabled="{{busy || itemIntent}}" placeholder="说明具体内容、适用范围与必要条件"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">交付办法</text><textarea value="{{itemForm.fulfillmentInstructions}}" data-field="fulfillmentInstructions" bindinput="itemField" maxlength="500" disabled="{{busy || itemIntent}}" placeholder="领取地点、预约办法或服务安排"/></view><view class="form-grid"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">所需兑换积分</text><input type="number" value="{{itemForm.pointsCost}}" data-field="pointsCost" bindinput="itemField" disabled="{{busy || itemIntent}}"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">实际库存／服务名额</text><input type="number" value="{{itemForm.totalStock}}" data-field="totalStock" bindinput="itemField" disabled="{{busy || itemIntent}}"/></view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">显示顺序（越小越靠前）</text><input type="number" value="{{itemForm.sortOrder}}" data-field="sortOrder" bindinput="itemField" disabled="{{busy || itemIntent}}"/></view><view class="redemption-note">库存总量包含已预留与已交付数量，不能低于二者之和。改价不改变已有申请。</view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">本次修改／发布原因</text><textarea value="{{itemForm.reason}}" data-field="reason" bindinput="itemField" maxlength="500" disabled="{{busy || itemIntent}}" placeholder="记录核定依据或调整原因"/></view><button class="primary full" bindtap="saveItem" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">{{itemIntent ? '重试核对原项目' : '保存项目'}}</button><view wx:if="{{itemForm.id && !itemIntent}}" class="actions"><button wx:if="{{itemForm.status !== 'published'}}" class="primary grow" data-action="publish" bindtap="itemStatus" disabled="{{busy}}">发布项目</button><button wx:if="{{itemForm.status !== 'archived'}}" class="secondary grow" data-action="archive" bindtap="itemStatus" disabled="{{busy}}">归档项目</button></view></view>
      </block>

      <block wx:if="{{managePane === 'requests'}}">
        <picker range="{{queueStateLabels}}" value="{{queueStateIndex}}" bindchange="queueState" disabled="{{busy || loading}}"><view class="picker">{{queueStateLabels[queueStateIndex]}} ▾</view></picker>
        <view wx:if="{{!queue.length && !loading}}" class="empty">当前没有{{queueStateLabels[queueStateIndex]}}的申请。</view>
        <view wx:for="{{queue}}" wx:key="id" class="card redemption-admin-item" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openRequest"><view class="row"><text class="card-title">{{item.itemName}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.stateText}}</text></view><view class="small mt">{{item.nickname || '成员'}} · 编号 {{item.memberNumber === undefined ? '待分配' : item.memberNumber}}</view><view class="small muted mt">{{item.totalCost}} 分 · {{item.dateText}}</view><view class="redemption-item-open">查看并处理 ›</view></view>
        <view wx:if="{{target}}" class="card redemption-editor"><view class="row"><text class="card-title">{{target.itemName}}</text><text class="tag">{{target.stateText}}</text></view><view class="small muted mt">{{target.nickname || '成员'}} · {{target.totalCost}} 分</view><view class="small paragraph mt">{{target.fulfillmentInstructions}}</view><view wx:if="{{target.reason}}" class="redemption-request-reason">最近处理：{{target.reason}}</view><view wx:if="{{target.memberActive === false}}" class="notice">该成员账号当前不可交付。待交付申请可拒绝并释放预留。</view><view wx:if="{{targetAccount.restricted}}" class="notice error">该账户积分有待核对差额，请先核对预留，暂不能交付核销。</view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">处理依据／原因（必填）</text><textarea value="{{adminReason}}" bindinput="adminReason" maxlength="500" placeholder="说明核对、实际交付或退回情况" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view><view wx:if="{{target.state === 'fulfilled'}}" class="field"><text class="field-label">整笔退回时的库存处理</text><picker range="{{restockLabels}}" value="{{restockIndex}}" bindchange="restock" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="picker">{{restockLabels[restockIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="actions"><button wx:if="{{target.state === 'pending'}}" class="primary grow" data-action="approve" bindtap="process" disabled="{{busy}}">批准，保留预留</button><button wx:if="{{target.state === 'pending' || target.state === 'approved'}}" class="secondary grow" data-action="reject" bindtap="process" disabled="{{busy}}">拒绝并释放预留</button><button wx:if="{{target.state === 'approved'}}" class="primary full" data-action="fulfill" bindtap="process" disabled="{{busy || targetAccount.restricted || target.memberActive === false}}">确认已交付并扣分</button><button wx:if="{{target.state === 'fulfilled'}}" class="secondary full" data-action="refund" bindtap="process" disabled="{{busy || restockIndex === 0}}">按原因整笔退回积分</button></view></view>
      </block>

      <view wx:if="{{managePane === 'policy' && policyHead}}" class="card redemption-policy-form"><view class="row"><text class="card-title">兑换积分规则</text><text class="tag">版本 {{policyHead.version}}</text></view><view class="switch-row field"><text>接受新的兑换申请</text><switch checked="{{policyEnabled}}" color="#ff6b00" bindchange="policyToggle" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">新活动的默认兑换奖励</text><picker range="{{rewardModes}}" value="{{rewardModeIndex}}" bindchange="rewardMode" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="picker">{{rewardModes[rewardModeIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">向车友公布的积分规则</text><textarea value="{{policyText}}" data-field="policyText" bindinput="policyField" maxlength="1000" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="说明兑换积分如何获取、适用范围和处理办法"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">本次变更原因</text><textarea value="{{policyReason}}" data-field="policyReason" bindinput="policyField" maxlength="500" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="填写核定或调整的依据"/></view><view class="redemption-note">每次保存形成新规则版本。已发布活动的奖励保持原样，历史成长积分不自动换算。关闭新申请后，已有记录及取消、审核、交付处理继续保留。</view><button class="primary full mt" bindtap="savePolicy" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">核实并保存规则</button></view>
    </block>
    <button wx:if="{{cursor && !loading}}" class="secondary full mt" bindtap="more" disabled="{{busy}}">查看更多</button>
  </block>
  <view class="footer-note">成长与年度积分不因兑换减少。兑换事项由俱乐部核定，积分不能转赠、交易或提现。</view>
</view>
